<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EMC Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EMC Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown upgraded EMC Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- EMC gained 3/4 to 39 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
